{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"closer\": \"Y\",\n  \"x_off\": [\n    \"S13把焦点更多放在想得到一句保证，以及通过收回喜欢来减少未来受伤，容易把核心转成对确定性和自我保护的顾虑。\",\n    \"S14主要落在回顾自己从不敢表达走向不再隐藏的变化，收束点偏向自我接纳与表达选择；幸福和留不住它的痛楚虽都在，但没有像Y那样直接交织呈现。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_off\": [\n    \"S13仍以想听到对方的保证为切入点，稍微带有把注意力集中到语言承诺上的倾向，但随即追问即使得到承诺，未来是否真的能维持，及时回到了核心。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"两条线前面基本一致，都呈现了亲密带来的幸福与对失去的预感如何相互牵动。Y在S13明确区分了得到保证与真正留住幸福的可能性，S14又直接把当下的甜蜜、未来的不确定和失去的酸楚放在同一刻，因此更完整地体现了Center，而不是把保证或自我表达当成主线。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa49297b-0e57-40b2-9ddf-f73fbeac4d06", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T075430962975Z", "elapsed_seconds": 16.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T07:54:46.961956+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a619fe4909ceab56f90e73ab667dc39e53d26187e723980ac8687f2c986d95db", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\g